#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Groupoid Cardinality of 1-types]

Let $X$ be a 1-type such that $pi_0 (X)$ is finite, and for all $x:X$ $"Aut"(x)$ is finite. Define the _groupoid cardinality_ of $X$ as the rational number

$
  |X| :-= plus.big_(c : pi_0 (X)) 1/(|"Aut"_X (c)|) : QQ,
$

where $plus.big$ denotes a finite sum over rational numbers indexed by the finite set $pi_0 (X)$.
